# MSBuild adds these switches to every command-line build of a project or solution under this folder.
# An IDE does not read the file.
#
# A solution builds a project that is not one of its own in that project's default configuration. The
# trading platform is such a project, so a release of the product would carry a debug build of it.
# With this off, the platform, and everything it references in turn, is built in the configuration the
# product is built in.
-p:ShouldUnsetParentConfigurationAndPlatform=false
